{
 "_about": "撒豆成兵 — the crowd run, a 塔防-family level type, a prototype (Hanli 10-20: 「对, 做一个撒豆成兵的关卡」; the genre: crowd + math gates, Count Masters / Mob Control; the art bar: 《向僵尸开炮》). 小满 scatters beans that become a squad of bean soldiers; they charge up the 山道 through 符门 gates (+ × good, − ÷ traps), past hazards and bean pickups, crash into the 兽潮 hordes (crowds cancel out) and end at 合窳. Drag left/right (A/D, ←/→ on Mac) steers. The engine: scripts/games/sadou/core.js (pure, headless, bots); the play: scripts/games/sadou/sadou.min.mjs (Phaser, built from tools/sadou/). Distances (`at`, `len`) are px along the road at `speed` px/s; lateral `x` is −1 (the road's left edge) … 1 (its right).",
 "beasts": {
  "_about": "power: how many soldiers one beast is worth in a clash. size: the drawn height px. frames: 守墙关's painted frames, shared (scripts/games/shouqiang/art/<id>-<frame>.webp); `run` alternates the walk frames, `hit` flashes on a loss. A boss has a `name` (the HP bar, the banner) and may have `face` (its box in the frame, fractions, for the road bar's icon); `art: \"sadou\"` = this game's own frames (scripts/games/sadou/art/: the 黑松岭 boss, tools/paint-sadou.py).",
  "yezhu": {"power": 2, "size": 66, "frames": ["walk-1"], "hit": "hit"},
  "zheng": {"power": 3, "size": 60, "frames": ["walk-1", "walk-2"], "hit": "hit"},
  "qiuyu": {"power": 2, "size": 58, "frames": ["walk-1", "walk-2"], "hit": "hit"},
  "qique": {"power": 1, "size": 58, "frames": ["walk-1", "walk-2"], "hit": "hit", "fly": true},
  "heyu": {"power": 1, "size": 360, "frames": ["walk-1"], "hit": "hit", "name": {"zh": "合窳", "en": "Heyu"}},
  "longzhi": {"power": 1, "size": 380, "frames": ["walk-1"], "hit": "hit", "art": "sadou", "face": [0.28, 0.4, 0.44, 0.38], "name": {"zh": "蠪侄", "en": "Longzhi"}}
 },
