   "lead": [
    {"zh": "蒙山的山道上，兽潮压下来了。", "en": "Down Mount Meng's road, the beast tide is coming."},
    {"zh": "小满抓出一把黄豆，往山道上一撒——", "en": "Xiaoman grabs a fistful of beans and flings them down the road —"},
    {"zh": "撒豆成兵！", "en": "Beans into soldiers!", "big": true}
   ],
   "leadSec": 4.6,
   "countdown": 3,
   "speed": 270,
   "steer": 3.2,
   "start": 15,
   "low": 8,
   "clashMin": 24,
   "stars": [180, 70],
   "_track": "In road order. gates: [left, right] (null = no gate on that side); op + − x /; `flip` px: the pair swaps sides every flip px still to run (翻符门, it lands as written). beans: a line of beans at x, +n if the crowd runs over it. hazard: kind spikes|log over x [a, b] for `len` px, `kill` = the share of the soldiers over it lost while crossing; `swing`/`period` sway a log side to side. rocks: 落石 at `at` + i·`gap`, each on [x − r, x + r] (`falls`: the xs), `kill` = the share under it lost, its shadow shown `warn` px ahead. horde: [[beast, n], …] across the whole road (`span` narrows it to a lane: run round it or through it), the first kind the back line. boss `moves`: the slam's pattern in turn (half · edges · middle). `difficulty`: the level's one knob, scaling every horde's beasts and the boss's hp (1 = as tuned). `tone`: a tint over the world (night, mist); `props`: the roadside mix.",
